      "id": 361448,
      "username": "trustedcomputer",
      "name": "Ben Erickson",
      "created_at": "2023-04-26T19:45:48.787Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tehn\">@tehn</a> What versions of Frappe/ERPNext are you running? This was bothering me for a long time until I reverted back to version-13 on Docker.</p>\n<p>See this github issue: <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/issues/18168\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Why email_sync_option is set to UNSEEN when we choose ALL ? · Issue #18168 · frappe/frappe · GitHub</a></p>\n<p>And as I look at the commit history, it looks like there is a <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/commit/b483deac3df8613fb155e7ca794e2cfae1d61661\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">refactoring</a> of the retrieve_message function in receive.py, which is where the problem might lie. I can’t tell if this will fix it or not once it gets merged into version-14. But it might.</p>",
